msgid ""
":mod:`dbm` (:mod:`!anydbm`, :mod:`!dbhash`, :mod:`!dbm`, :mod:`!"
"dumbdbm`, :mod:`!gdbm`, :mod:`!whichdb`)."
msgstr ""
":mod:`dbm` (:mod:`!anydbm`, :mod:`!dbhash`, :mod:`!dbm`, :mod:`!"
"dumbdbm`, :mod:`!gdbm`, :mod:`!whichdb`)."

